Subject: [PATCH] fix(lockscreen): cancel pending authentication with Escape

Escape clears the prompt but leaves m_authenticating set, keeping buttons
disabled until the old PAM attempt returns. Cancel the helper, invalidate
its result, and restore prompt interactivity without changing the PAM
service or stack. Keep cancellation registered until helper exit and
remove it before reaping to avoid signalling a reused PID.

Include deterministic helper-protocol tests that do not invoke system PAM.

Backport to Noctalia 5.6.0: thread the stop token through the separate
noctalia-pam-helper executable and its versioned protocol. The test points
NOCTALIA_PAM_HELPER_PATH at itself to impersonate the helper.
